  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kader \xC7ark\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nGe\xE7mi\u015Fte alamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n virajlar, \"dur\" diyemedi\u011Fin
    k\xF6t\xFCye gidi\u015Fler olmu\u015F. Sen her zorlukta \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa
    do\u011Fru ko\u015Fmu\u015Fsun fakat kader yollar\u0131n\u0131 tekrar tekrar
    kapatm\u0131\u015F. Yeni ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7lar ya gecikmi\u015F ya da iptal
    olmu\u015F. S\xFCreci devam eden i\u015Flerin yoku\u015Flara tak\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.
    Ne yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131, nas\u0131l yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilememi\u015F,
    sorunlar\u0131n \xFCstesinden bir anda gelememi\u015Fsin {{isim}}. Mevcut hi\xE7bir
    istikamet sana \xFCmit vadetmedi\u011Finde, kendine yeni yollar a\xE7maya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F,
    daha \xF6nce g\xF6r\xFClmemi\u015F \xE7\xF6z\xFCmler \xFCretmeye gayret etmi\u015Fsin.
    Denenmemi\u015Fi yaratmak mevcut halinle zor geldi\u011Finde, sen de de\u011Fi\u015Fmi\u015F,
    yenilenmi\u015F, o \u015Fekilde ilerlemi\u015Fsin."
